Medium
Patients with no city information
1) List patients (first_name, last_name) who do not have a city recorded (city IS NULL)
Code: 
select first_name,last_name
from patients
where city is null;

#Hard#
1) Heaviest Patient Per City
Show the city, patient's first_name, and their weight for the heaviest patient in each city.
code:
select city,first_name, weight
from patients p
where weight = (
    select max(weight)
    from patients 
    where city = p.city
);

2) Oldest Patients By Gender
For each gender, list the first_name and birth_date of the oldest patient(s).
code:
select first_name,birth_date,gender
from patients p
where birth_date =(
    select min(birth_date)
    from patients
    where gender = p.gender
);

3) Patients with Long Names
Show first_name and last_name of patients where the combined length exceeds 25 characters.
code:
select first_name,last_name
from patients
where length(first_name || last_name) > 25;


